       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**The problem:** Sertraline 1000 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose of 200 mg/day. Normal adult dosing is:\n- **Starting dose:** 25\u201350 mg once daily\n- **Usual range:** 50\u2013200 mg once daily\n- **Maximum:** 200 mg/day\n\nAt 1000 mg/day there's a real risk of serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and seizures. This looks like it could be a typo, like an extra zero added to **100 mg**.\n\n**Please tell me which you want:**\n1. **Sertraline 100 mg** by mouth once daily (or another dose within 25\u2013200 mg), or\n2. **1000 mg as written.** If this is intentional, please confirm it and give the clinical reason so I can add it to the order note. Even then, it would be wise to check with pharmacy before it's given.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order."
      }
     ],
